        <dc:description>&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An expedition from Miskatonic University digs up what lay under the Antarctic ice, and the geologist who comes back writes it all down to keep the next expedition away. Serialised in &lt;em&gt;Astounding Stories&lt;/em&gt; over February, March and April 1936.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</dc:description>
